It is Wednesday evening.
It is seven o'clock.
I am at the local gym.
I usually train twice a week.
I am always here on Wednesdays.
I change clothes.
First, I lift weights.
The weights are very heavy.
I take a short break.
Afterwards, I run on the treadmill.
I often run fast.
I always listen to music.
I train for one hour in total.
Now it is eight o'clock.
I am tired, but I am happy.
I take my bag.
I walk home.
